  "contentval": "000Sfzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/1777",
  "contentHtml": "<p>학교에서 갤탭을 한 대 받아 유용하게 사용해보겠다고 생각했으나, 딱히 뭐 할 게 없었어요. (저는 아이폰, 아이패드 사용중)</p><p>학생 1인 1기기가 갤탭으로 모두 배치된 후, 학생들이 뭔가 해보게 하려고 하다보니, 제가 캘탭을 알아야겠기에 ‘갤럭시탭 활용’으로 가아끔 검색해보고 있습니다. </p><p>&#160;</p><p>주말동안 갤탭 활용 기능 찾아보다, 세컨드스크린 기능을 알게 되었습니다. 그런데, 갤탭 S7 부터 이 기능이 있다고 하는데.. 검색하다보니 어찌어찌 사용하는 길이 있었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아래 사진은 S7, S8에서 뜨는 &#39;세컨드 스크린&#39;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/bf089eeeb5eb12f302c0f6a771f5d861f71ddc13_re_1682935262953\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"555\" height=\"171\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/bf089eeeb5eb12f302c0f6a771f5d861f71ddc13_re_1682935262953\" data-origin-width=\"843\" data-origin-height=\"260\"></div><p>상단바를 내리면 바로 &lt;세컨드 스크린&gt;이라고 뜬대요. 이거 활성화해놓으면 탭을 보조모니터로 바로 사용 가능.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>직전 모델인 S6 lite에는 이 기능이 없는데.. 숨어 있다네요. </p><p>--------------------------</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>갤럭시 탭 S6 lite 에서 세컨드스크린 기능 사용하는 방법 <br><br>1.&#160;설정-&gt;기기&#160;간&#160;연결-&gt;Smart&#160;View-&gt;(다음,계속)-&gt;오른쪽&#160;위&#160;점&#160;3개-&gt;설정-&gt;Smart&#160;View&#160;앱&#160;정보-&gt;&quot;Smart&#160;View&quot;&#160;연타(여러번&#160;두드리면&#160;열림)-&gt;Start&#160;SecondScreen&#160;활성화시킴-&gt;&quot;Start&#160;SecondScreen&quot;&#160;연타-&gt;&#160;모니터&#160;2개&#160;나오는&#160;화면(&#9733;)-&gt;&#160;이&#160;창&#160;띄운&#160;상태에서</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/3221a911baa965d1cd889e5db3c2ac1899f0ecd2_re_1682935262953\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"630\" height=\"444\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/3221a911baa965d1cd889e5db3c2ac1899f0ecd2_re_1682935262953\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"845\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/da90982e96732102d0b4ca55e0ae4ff053cad6b5_re_1682935262953\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"626\" height=\"251\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/da90982e96732102d0b4ca55e0ae4ff053cad6b5_re_1682935262953\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"482\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/47781f4e35d33bab85d39058d369af45fcdbf50b_re_1682935262953\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"620\" height=\"283\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/47781f4e35d33bab85d39058d369af45fcdbf50b_re_1682935262953\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"548\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/178f3660345cfbdd40336a1bbc6d85def9edeee1_re_1682935262954\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"612\" height=\"516\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/178f3660345cfbdd40336a1bbc6d85def9edeee1_re_1682935262954\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"1011\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/edf8080f59d15dcba968286473ed3cc5dbadf2cf_re_1682935262954\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"612\" height=\"437\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/edf8080f59d15dcba968286473ed3cc5dbadf2cf_re_1682935262954\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"857\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/f648133f12c5916c816a321d0bed14e8d13e984b_re_1682935262954\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"620\" height=\"629\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/f648133f12c5916c816a321d0bed14e8d13e984b_re_1682935262954\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"1217\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/f8931551c313798c1f859d8b2ba24b9089057a9d_re_1682935262954\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"626\" height=\"807\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1UBcp/f8931551c313798c1f859d8b2ba24b9089057a9d_re_1682935262954\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"1547\"></div><p><br><br>2.&#160;노트북에서&#160;Window+k&#160;누르면&#160;연결가능 <br><br>(갤탭만&#160;가능한&#160;게&#160;아니고,&#160;폰,&#160;다른&#160;태블릿&#160;모두&#160;가능하다고&#160;함. 확인 안 해봄.)<br><br>------ <br>듀얼모니터&#160;사용하고&#160;싶을&#160;때,&#160;&#160;갤럽시&#160;탭에서&#160;(&#9733;)&#160;화면상태여야&#160;노트북과&#160;연결&#160;가능. <br>노트북에서&#160;Window+k&#160;누르면&#160;갤탭이&#160;뜨긴&#160;하는데,&#160;연결&#160;안&#160;됨.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
